<!DOCTYPE html><html lang="en" dir="ltr" style="--brand-primary:#1D4E89;--brand-accent:#D9A441;--brand-accent2:#3F6E58;--brand-cta:#1D4E89;--bg:#FBF5E9;--ink:#1E1B16;--brand-ink:#1E1B16;--ink-soft:#5B4F3F;--brand-ink-soft:#5B4F3F;--line:#E6D9BE;--brand-cta-text:#FBF5E9;--font-display:&#34;Marcellus&#34;, &#34;Noto Sans JP&#34;, &#34;Noto Sans KR&#34;, &#34;Noto Sans SC&#34;, &#34;Noto Sans TC&#34;, Georgia, &#34;Times New Roman&#34;, serif;--font:&#34;Lora&#34;, &#34;Noto Sans JP&#34;, &#34;Noto Sans KR&#34;, &#34;Noto Sans SC&#34;, &#34;Noto Sans TC&#34;, Georgia, &#34;Times New Roman&#34;, serif;--font-mono:&#34;IBM Plex Mono&#34;, ui-monospace, &#34;SF Mono&#34;, monospace;--radius-card:8px;--radius-pill:999px"> <head><meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1"><link rel="icon" type="image/svg+xml" href="/favicon-palacio-andaluz.svg"><meta name="theme-color" content="#1D4E89"><title>Flamenco at El Palacio Andaluz | Seville Tickets</title><meta name="description" content="Book the flamenco show at El Palacio Andaluz on GetYourGuide — Seville's largest flamenco stage, a dress museum included, plus drink, tapas or dinner tiers."><link rel="canonical" href="https://palacioandaluz.com/"><link rel="alternate" hreflang="en" href="https://palacioandaluz.com/"><link rel="alternate" hreflang="de" href="https://palacioandaluz.com/de/"><link rel="alternate" hreflang="fr" href="https://palacioandaluz.com/fr/"><link rel="alternate" hreflang="es" href="https://palacioandaluz.com/es/"><link rel="alternate" hreflang="it" href="https://palacioandaluz.com/it/"><link rel="alternate" hreflang="pt" href="https://palacioandaluz.com/pt/"><link rel="alternate" hreflang="nl" href="https://palacioandaluz.com/nl/"><link rel="alternate" hreflang="pl" href="https://palacioandaluz.com/pl/"><link rel="alternate" hreflang="ja" href="https://palacioandaluz.com/ja/"><link rel="alternate" hreflang="ko" href="https://palacioandaluz.com/ko/"><link rel="alternate" hreflang="zh-CN" href="https://palacioandaluz.com/zh-CN/"><link rel="alternate" hreflang="zh-TW" href="https://palacioandaluz.com/zh-TW/"><link rel="alternate" hreflang="tr" href="https://palacioandaluz.com/tr/"><link rel="alternate" hreflang="ru" href="https://palacioandaluz.com/ru/"><link rel="alternate" hreflang="cs" href="https://palacioandaluz.com/cs/"><link rel="alternate" hreflang="sk" href="https://palacioandaluz.com/sk/"><link rel="alternate" hreflang="el" href="https://palacioandaluz.com/el/"><link rel="alternate" hreflang="sv" href="https://palacioandaluz.com/sv/"><link rel="alternate" hreflang="da" href="https://palacioandaluz.com/da/"><link rel="alternate" hreflang="uk" href="https://palacioandaluz.com/uk/"><link rel="alternate" hreflang="x-default" href="https://palacioandaluz.com/"><script>(function(){const o=["de","fr","es","it","pt","nl","pl","ja","ko","zh-CN","zh-TW","tr","ru","cs","sk","el","sv","da","uk"],l=["de","fr","es","it","pt","nl","pl","ja","ko","zh-CN","zh-TW","tr","ru","cs","sk","el","sv","da","uk"],t="en";(function(){try{let a=function(i){for(var e=0;e<l.length;e++){var n=l[e];if(i==="/"+n||i.indexOf("/"+n+"/")===0)return n}return null},x=function(i){var e=document.cookie.match(new RegExp("(?:^|; )"+i+"=([^;]+)"));return e?decodeURIComponent(e[1]):null},h=function(i){document.cookie=s+"="+i+"; Path=/; Max-Age="+k+"; SameSite=Lax"},O=function(i){for(var e=0;e<i.length;e++){var n=(i[e]||"").toLowerCase();if(n){if(n.indexOf("zh")===0){for(var m=n.indexOf("tw")>=0||n.indexOf("hk")>=0||n.indexOf("hant")>=0,v=m?["zh","zh-CN"]:["zh-CN","zh"],f=0;f<v.length;f++)if(o.indexOf(v[f])>=0)return v[f];continue}var d=n.split("-")[0];if(n===t||d===t)return t;if(o.indexOf(n)>=0)return n;if(o.indexOf(d)>=0)return d}}return null};var C=a,p=x,z=h,L=O;if(!o||!o.length)return;var u=location.pathname,s="site_locale",k=2592e3,c=a(u);if(c){o.indexOf(c)>=0&&h(c);return}var r=x(s);if(r&&(r===t||o.indexOf(r)>=0)||(r=O(navigator.languages||[navigator.language||""])),!r||r===t)return;h(r),location.replace("/"+r+(u==="/"?"/":u)+location.search+location.hash)}catch{}})()})();</script><link rel="preload" as="font" type="font/woff2" href="/fonts/marcellus-400.woff2" crossorigin><link rel="preload" as="font" type="font/woff2" href="/fonts/lora-var.woff2" crossorigin><meta property="og:title" content="Flamenco at El Palacio Andaluz | Seville Tickets"><meta property="og:description" content="Book the flamenco show at El Palacio Andaluz on GetYourGuide — Seville's largest flamenco stage, a dress museum included, plus drink, tapas or dinner tiers."><meta property="og:type" content="website"><meta property="og:image" content="https://palacioandaluz.com/img/palacio-andaluz-og.webp"><meta name="twitter:card" content="summary_large_image"><meta name="robots" content="index,follow,max-image-preview:large"><script type="application/ld+json">{"@context":"https://schema.org","@graph":[{"@type":"Organization","name":"El Palacio Andaluz","url":"https://palacioandaluz.com","description":"Independent booking guide for El Palacio Andaluz. We help travellers book tickets via trusted partners."},{"@type":"TouristAttraction","name":"El Palacio Andaluz","description":"A sixteen-piece programme runs alegrías to bulería in about ninety minutes, twice every night."},{"@type":"FAQPage","mainEntity":[{"@type":"Question","name":"What happens during the evening?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Doors open with time to see the Flamenco Dress Museum, included with every ticket, before the room is seated for a sixteen-piece programme — alegrías to bulería, about ninety minutes, with no interval. Show-only tickets sit to the side; the drink and dinner tiers are served at tables facing the stage."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"What dance styles are in the show?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"The published running order moves through alegrías, soleá, fandango, tientos, guajira, a flamenco adaptation of scenes from Bizet's Carmen, two tangos, farruca, cantiñas, caracoles, martinete and seguiriyas, closing with the full cast on sevillanas and bulería."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Is dinner included?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Only on the dinner tier. Show-only gets you a side seat and the museum; the drink tier adds a cava and a chocolate truffle; the dinner tier adds a three-course Andalusian menu with wine at a table facing the stage."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Where exactly is El Palacio Andaluz?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"On Isla de la Cartuja, the island across the Guadalquivir from Seville's old town, in a converted pavilion from the 1992 Universal Expo — reachable on urban bus lines C2, C3, 03 or 06, with a hop-on-hop-off tourist bus stop nearby."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Should I book the 19:00 or the 21:30 show?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Both sittings run the identical sixteen-piece programme, so it comes down to the rest of your evening — an earlier finish if you choose 19:00, or dinner in town first if you choose 21:30."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Is the Flamenco Dress Museum worth the extra time?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"It's included with every ticket rather than sold separately, and it's built to be seen in the roughly half hour before the room is seated — arriving right at showtime means missing it rather than saving time."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Is it suitable for children?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"The venue doesn't publish a minimum age on its own booking pages; check the age guidance on the GetYourGuide listing at checkout before booking for young children."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Can I cancel if my plans change?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Plans change — a GetYourGuide booking here can be cancelled free of charge right up to 24 hours before curtain, and the currency-converted total shows at checkout rather than being left to guesswork."}}]},{"@type":"BreadcrumbList","itemListElement":[{"@type":"ListItem","position":1,"name":"Home","item":"https://palacioandaluz.com"},{"@type":"ListItem","position":2,"name":"El Palacio Andaluz","item":"https://palacioandaluz.com"}]}]}</script><script async src="https://www.googletagmanager.com/gtag/js?id=G-BYLGBD0BK4"></script><script>(function(){const a="G-BYLGBD0BK4";window.dataLayer=window.dataLayer||[],window.gtag=function(){window.dataLayer.push(arguments)},window.gtag("js",new Date),window.gtag("config",a)})();</script><style>@font-face{font-family:Inter;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;font-display:swap;src:url(/fonts/inter-400.woff2) format("woff2")}@font-face{font-family:Inter;font-style:normal;font-weight:700;font-display:swap;src:url(/fonts/inter-700.woff2) format("woff2")}@font-face{font-family:Fraunces;font-style:normal;font-weight:600;font-display:swap;src:url(/fonts/fraunces-600.woff2) format("woff2")}@font-face{font-family:Fraunces;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;font-display:swap;src:url(/fonts/fraunces-400.woff2) format("woff2")}@font-face{font-family:Fraunces;font-style:normal;font-weight:700;font-display:swap;src:url(/fonts/fraunces-700.woff2) format("woff2")}@font-face{font-family:Fraunces;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;font-display:swap;src:url(/fonts/fraunces-latinext.woff2) format("woff2");unicode-range:U+0100-02BA,U+02BD-02C5,U+02C7-02CC,U+02CE-02D7,U+02DD-02FF,U+0304,U+0308,U+0329,U+1D00-1DBF,U+1E00-1E9F,U+1EF2-1EFF,U+2020,U+20A0-20AB,U+20AD-20C0,U+2113,U+2C60-2C7F,U+A720-A7FF}@font-face{font-family:Fraunces;font-style:normal;font-weight:600;font-display:swap;src:url(/fonts/fraunces-latinext.woff2) format("woff2");unicode-range:U+0100-02BA,U+02BD-02C5,U+02C7-02CC,U+02CE-02D7,U+02DD-02FF,U+0304,U+0308,U+0329,U+1D00-1DBF,U+1E00-1E9F,U+1EF2-1EFF,U+2020,U+20A0-20AB,U+20AD-20C0,U+2113,U+2C60-2C7F,U+A720-A7FF}@font-face{font-family:Fraunces;font-style:normal;font-weight:700;font-display:swap;src:url(/fonts/fraunces-latinext.woff2) format("woff2");un